+### B.3 Deferred to conformance task E (`0.4.0`)
+
+| Vector | Expected | Rule |
+|---|---|---|
+| `REPID_RATING2` valid (`byte[1] score + byte[32] commentHash`), right tracked | `RATING_ISSUED` with `commentHash` | RF-W64 |
+| `REPID_RATING2` with a 1-byte payload | no fact | RF-W65 |
+| `REPID_RATING2` with two chunks (the `REPID_RATING1` shape) | no fact | RF-W65 |
+| `REPID_RETRACT1` valid 32-byte reference to a known rating signed by the rater | `RATING_RETRACTION` | RF-W66 |
+| `REPID_RETRACT1` with a 20-byte payload | no fact | RF-W67 |
+| `REPID_RETRACT1` referencing an unknown rating | `valid: false` | RF-W68 |
+| `REPID_RETRACT1` from a wallet that is not the rater of the referenced rating | `valid: false` | RF-W69 |
+| A second retraction of the same rating | `valid: false` | RF-W70 |
+| Platform confirming a Receipt it is a party to (`platformPkh` ∈ {partyA, partyB}) | `valid: false` | RF-W71 |
+| Receipt commitment of 4 bytes (`0x10`) with unknown `category`/`role` values | `RECEIPT_GENESIS` with raw `receiptContext` | RF-W73 |
+| Receipt commitment of 36 bytes (`0x11`) | `RECEIPT_GENESIS` with `receiptContext.contextHash` | RF-W73 |
+| Receipt commitment of 1/2/3/5…35 or 37+ bytes, or a reserved format/flag (`0x00`, `0x11`, `0x1f`) | no fact | RF-W73 |
+| Identity vault `burn()` at `age < 144` | rejected by the VM (covenant), not a recognizer test | RF-O831 |
+| Identity vault spent with the `0.4.0` body, recorded under its pre-`0.4.0` binding | no fact, per declared set | RF-W76 |
